  "timing": "serial fresh processes, alternating order; >=1000 ms warmup, three target 300 ms batches; function entry/return, output allocation and host-array forcing included; input and independent oracle prepared outside timing",
  "sources": {
    "kmeans": "rem Deep-ML 17: K-Means Clustering\nrem https://www.deep-ml.com/problems/17\n\nuse numbers\nuse sequences\nuse stats\n\nrem Assign points to their nearest centroid and recompute cluster means.\nfun Points K InitialCentroids Max k_means\n  Samples = Points real\n  Centroids = InitialCentroids real\n  N = Points len\n  fun Centroids step\n    Labels = array shape N fill 0\n    for i in 0 till N\n      Point = Samples i\n      Best = 0\n\n      D = Point - Centroids 0\n      BestDist = D * D sum\n\n      for c in 1 till K\n        D = Point - Centroids c\n        Dist = D * D sum\n\n        if Dist less BestDist\n          BestDist = Dist\n          Best = c\n        end\n      end\n\n      Labels i = Best\n    end\n\n    Next = Centroids copy\n\n    for c in 0 till K\n      Mask = Labels equal c\n      Cluster = Samples Mask #\n\n      if Cluster len greater 0\n        Next c = Cluster mean axis 0\n      end\n    end\n\n    return Next\n  end\n\n  fun Prev done Next\n    return Prev Next equal rank 2\n  end\n\n  Result = Centroids step repeat Max till done\n  return Result round 4\nend\n",
    "convolution": "rem Deep-ML 41: Simple Conv2D\nrem https://www.deep-ml.com/problems/41\n\nuse sequences\n\nfun A' K P S simple_conv2d\n  W = K shape\n  B' = A window W stride S padding P\n  return B * K sum rank 2\nend\n",
    "softmax": "rem Deep-ML 23: Softmax\nrem https://www.deep-ml.com/problems/23\n\nuse numbers\n\nrem Normalize scores with stable exp.\nfun X softmax\n  Shift' = X - (X max)\n  Exps = Shift exp\n  return Exps / (Exps sum)\nend\n",
    "logsoftmax": "rem Deep-ML 39: Log Softmax\nrem https://www.deep-ml.com/problems/39\n\nuse numbers\n\nfun Scores log_softmax\n  Shift = Scores - (Scores max)\n  Normalizer = Shift exp sum log\n  return Shift - Normalizer round 4\nend\n",
    "gradient": "rem Deep-ML 15: Gradient Descent\nrem https://www.deep-ml.com/problems/15\n\nuse linalg\nuse numbers\nuse sequences\n\nrem Fit linear coefficients with a fixed number of gradient updates.\nfun X Y Rate Steps linear_regression\n  Shape = X shape\n  YShape = Y shape\n  if Shape len not equal 2\n    .DimensionMismatch raise\n  end\n  if YShape len not equal 1\n    .DimensionMismatch raise\n  end\n\n  M = Shape 0\n  N = Shape 1\n  if YShape 0 not equal M\n    .DimensionMismatch raise\n  end\n\n  Features = X real rank 0\n  Targets = Y real rank 0\n  Theta = array shape N fill 0.0\n\n  for Step in 0 till Steps\n    Pred = Features matmul Theta\n    Error = Pred - Targets\n\n    Grad' = Features matmul Error axis 0 0\n    Grad' = Grad / (M real)\n\n    Theta -= Rate * Grad\n  end\n\n  return Theta round 4\nend\n",
    "distance": "fun A distance B\n D = A - B\n return D * D sum\nend",
    "moving": "fun X moving\n W' = X window 32\n return (W * 0.5 + 1) mean rank 1\nend",
    "rowStats": "fun X rowStats\n return ((X - 1) * (X + 1)) sum rank 1\nend"
  },
